Profile, and Review pages\n- Individual component test specifications with test cases and expected outcomes\n\n### 4. App Description Files\n\n**AppSpec.md** (`/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/AppSpec.md`)\nThis is the main app specification containing:\n- **Overview:** A vacation rental marketplace where hosts can list properties and guests can browse, search, and book stays\n- **Data Model:** Complete schema for Users, Properties, Property Images, Amenities, Bookings, Reviews, and Favorites\n- **Pages:** 7 main pages including Login, Home/Search, Property Detail, My Trips, Host Dashboard, User Profile, and Write Review\n- **API Endpoints:** All Netlify Functions endpoints for Auth, Users, Properties, Bookings, Reviews, Favorites, and Amenities\n- **Visual Design:** Design guidelines with Airbnb-inspired aesthetic\n\n**Test Files in `/repo/apps/AirbnbClone/tests/`** (30 spec files):\n- `booking-card.spec.ts` - Booking card component tests\n- `add-listing-form.spec.ts` - Listing creation form\n- `auth.spec.ts` - Authentication tests\n- `profile-form.spec.ts` - User profile editing\n- `write-review-form.spec.ts` - Review submission\n- And 25 other comprehensive test files covering all components and pages"},{"type":"text","text":"agentId: ab75667b8d1ea13cc (for resuming to continue this agent's work if needed)\n<usage>total_tokens: 31939\ntool_uses: 12\nduration_ms: 15635</usage>"}]}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"5ab1d8c1-1a0a-4757-b233-42915719b9b9","uuid":"41c13d6a-3881-4417-b326-d8738aca5d50","tool_use_result":{"status":"completed","prompt":"Find the app directory structure. I need to know:\n1. Which app directory contains a tests/booking-card.spec.ts file\n2. List the contents of that app's directory\n3. Find the tests.md file for that app\n4. Find any spec.md or app description files\n\nSearch in /repo/apps/ for these files. Be thorough.","agentId":"ab75667b8d1ea13cc","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Excellent! Now I have all the information needed. Let me pr